---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Audicap Blog - Chrome Audio Transcription Guides"
  description="Practical guides for live transcription, Chrome tab audio, Google Meet notes, YouTube transcripts, SRT export, and pay-as-you-go transcription workflows."
  canonical="https://audicap.work/blog/"
  hreflangs={[{'lang': 'en', 'url': 'https://audicap.work/blog/'}, {'lang': 'x-default', 'url': 'https://audicap.work/blog/'}]}
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "CollectionPage",
    "name": "Audicap Blog",
    "url": "https://audicap.work/blog/",
    "description": "Guides for Chrome audio transcription, live translation, transcript export, summaries, and pay-as-you-go transcription workflows.",
    "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "name": "Audicap", "url": "https://audicap.work/" }
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  
<section class="resource-hero">
<div class="container">
<span class="eyebrow">SEO guides</span>
<h1>Chrome Audio Transcription Guides</h1>
<p>Actionable articles for people who need live transcripts, translations, summaries, and exports from audio playing in regular Chrome tabs.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="resource-grid">
<div class="container">
<div class="content-card-grid">
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/transcribe-udemy-coursera-courses">
<span>Student guide</span>
<h3>How to Transcribe Udemy and Coursera Courses</h3>
<p>Turn online courses into searchable notes and dual-language translations.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/transcribe-microsoft-teams-web">
<span>Enterprise guide</span>
<h3>How to Transcribe Microsoft Teams Web Without a Bot</h3>
<p>A simple workaround for getting meeting notes in strict corporate environments.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/summarize-long-youtube-videos">
<span>Productivity guide</span>
<h3>How to Summarize Long YouTube Videos and Lectures</h3>
<p>Generate AI summaries directly from browser audio capture.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/transcribe-google-meet-without-bot">
<span>Google Meet</span>
<h3>How to Transcribe Google Meet Without Adding a Bot</h3>
<p>A practical guide to capturing meeting audio from Chrome while avoiding extra meeting participants.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/transcribe-youtube-video-in-chrome">
<span>YouTube</span>
<h3>How to Transcribe YouTube Videos in Chrome</h3>
<p>Turn lectures, tutorials, podcasts, and creator videos into searchable notes and summaries.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/use-cases/youtube-transcript-generator">
<span>Use case</span>
<h3>YouTube Transcript Generator for Chrome</h3>
<p>Generate live transcripts, translations, summaries, and SRT drafts from YouTube tab audio.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/transcribe-zoom-web">
<span>Zoom web</span>
<h3>How to Transcribe Zoom Web in Chrome</h3>
<p>Create personal transcript notes from Zoom meetings, webinars, demos, and classes in Chrome.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/pay-as-you-go-transcription-students">
<span>Student budget</span>
<h3>Pay-As-You-Go vs Monthly Transcription Plans</h3>
<p>Learn when subscriptions make sense and when a credit-based transcription workflow is more economical.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/live-translation-chrome-audio">
<span>Translation</span>
<h3>Live Translation for Chrome Audio</h3>
<p>Understand foreign videos, courses, webinars, and meetings with live translation during playback.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/live-captions-translation">
<span>Live captions</span>
<h3>Live Captions Translation for Chrome Audio</h3>
<p>Follow foreign-language videos and meetings with live transcription and translated captions.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/blog/export-transcript-to-srt">
<span>Subtitles</span>
<h3>How to Export Chrome Audio Transcripts to SRT</h3>
<p>Create subtitle drafts for YouTube, training videos, podcasts, and internal content faster.</p>
</a>
<a class="content-card" href="/alternatives/otter-ai">
<span>Comparison</span>
<h3>Audicap vs Otter.ai for Chrome Audio</h3>
<p>Compare meeting-bot transcription with a lightweight browser-tab audio workflow.</p>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="cta">
<div class="container">
<h2>Start with 30 Free Minutes</h2>
<p>Install Audicap to transcribe Chrome tab audio with no subscription and no meeting bot.</p>
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/audicap/cfalkkjbhiohkomajlelefmllnoniloo?utm_source=audicap_website&amp;utm_medium=seo&amp;utm_campaign=blog_index">Add to Chrome</a>
</div>
</section>

</Layout>
